{"branch":"삼송점","html":"<p class=\"kd-intro\">삼송점의 위치와 주변 교통편을 확인하세요.</p><div class=\"kd-map-slot\" data-kakao-src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-3c1ac6f6a9b3b342.html\" style=\"height:398px\"><p class=\"kd-map-pending\" role=\"status\">위치 지도를 준비하고 있습니다.</p><template><iframe class=\"kd-map-frame\" width=\"640\" height=\"398\" style=\"height:398px\" loading=\"lazy\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" title=\"삼송점 카카오맵 지도\" src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-3c1ac6f6a9b3b342.html\"></iframe></template></div><noscript><style>.kd-map-slot{display:none}</style><p class=\"kd-note\">위의 지도 이미지와 아래 주소를 기준으로 위치를 확인해 주세요.</p></noscript><p class=\"kd-address\"><strong>주소</strong><span>경기 고양시 덕양구 신원로 36 명승세도나3차 7층 701호</span></p><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 정류장</h3><ol class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-number\">1</span><span>신원마을6단지정문앞</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">2</span><span>신원마을5단지</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">3</span><span>신원상가앞</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">4</span><span>신원마을6단지</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">5</span><span>신원마을5단지</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">6</span><span>신원상가앞</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">7</span><span>신원마을6단지</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">8</span><span>신원마을4단지</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">9</span><span>신원마을2.4단지</span></li></ol></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 버스</h3><dl class=\"kd-buses\"><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">마을</span></dt><dd><span>033</span><span>040</span><span>047</span><span>048</span><span>075B</span><span>041B</span><span>025</span><span>026</span><span>037</span><span>053</span><span>077A</span><span>088</span><span>093</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">일반</span></dt><dd><span>999</span><span>313</span><span>313-1</span><span>17</span><span>30</span><span>31</span><span>374</span><span>790</span><span>799</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">